   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "§2 of docs/02-algorithms.md  ·  RFC 5286 §1 (Inequality 3), §3.2  ·  RFC 7916 §6.2.2  ·  code: src/engine/lfa.ts (nodeProtecting)",
