  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 715,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: N’s path to D is cheaper than any path through E",
   "originalText": "The rule: N’s path to D is cheaper than any path through E",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 616,
   "height": 23,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "node-protecting   ⇔   dist(N,D)  <  dist(N,E) + dist(E,D)",
   "originalText": "node-protecting   ⇔   dist(N,D)  <  dist(N,E) + dist(E,D)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 962,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  The same shape as loop-free (B3), with router E in place of S. The right side is N’s cheapest path\n   to D through E.\n•  Strictly cheaper ⇒ N’s path doesn’t touch E, so the backup survives the whole router failing, not\n   only the link S–E.\n•  A tie counts as \"may use E\": the RFC asks for strictly less.",
   "originalText": "•  The same shape as loop-free (B3), with router E in place of S. The right side is N’s cheapest path\n   to D through E.\n•  Strictly cheaper ⇒ N’s path doesn’t touch E, so the backup survives the whole router failing, not\n   only the link S–E.\n•  A tie counts as \"may use E\": the RFC asks for strictly less.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 316,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 350,
   "width": 698,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example      S → D   N    dist(N,D)  dist(N,E) + dist(E,D)   Node-prot.  Downstream\n-----------  ------  ---  ---------  ----------------------  ----------  ----------\n§15 policy   S → D   A    2          1 + 1   = 2             ✗ 2 = 2     ✓\n§15 policy   S → D   B    11         12 + 1  = 13            ✓ 11 < 13   ✗\n1  square    S → D   N    10         20 + 10 = 30            ✓ 10 < 30   ✓\n6            S → D   N    2          1 + 1   = 2             ✗ 2 = 2     ✗\n2  ring      S → C   A    2          2 + 1   = 3             ✓ 2 < 3     ✗",
   "originalText": "Example      S → D   N    dist(N,D)  dist(N,E) + dist(E,D)   Node-prot.  Downstream\n-----------  ------  ---  ---------  ----------------------  ----------  ----------\n§15 policy   S → D   A    2          1 + 1   = 2             ✗ 2 = 2     ✓\n§15 policy   S → D   B    11         12 + 1  = 13            ✓ 11 < 13   ✗\n1  square    S → D   N    10         20 + 10 = 30            ✓ 10 < 30   ✓\n6            S → D   N    2          1 + 1   = 2             ✗ 2 = 2     ✗\n2  ring      S → C   A    2          2 + 1   = 3             ✓ 2 < 3     ✗",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 483,
   "width": 501,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Simulated: fail router E, from S, LFA only (A9)",
   "originalText": "Simulated: fail router E, from S, LFA only (A9)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 517,
   "width": 656,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example / policy                 S’s LFA  Result for D\n-------------------------------  -------  -----------------------------------\n§15, default                     B        S → B → D, cost 13: survives\n§15, node_protecting: ignore     A        broken at A, then loops S → A → S\n1, default                       N        S → N → D, cost 25: survives\n6, default                       N        broken at N; N’s own LFA M saves it:\n                                          S → N → M → D, cost 21",
   "originalText": "Example / policy                 S’s LFA  Result for D\n-------------------------------  -------  -----------------------------------\n§15, default                     B        S → B → D, cost 13: survives\n§15, node_protecting: ignore     A        broken at A, then loops S → A → S\n1, default                       N        S → N → D, cost 25: survives\n6, default                       N        broken at N; N’s own LFA M saves it:\n                                          S → N → M → D, cost 21",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
