   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Edge cases",
   "originalText": "Edge cases",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-54",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 800,
   "width": 486,
   "height": 192,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 427626,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5655366,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  D = E: node protection can’t apply (E is the\n   destination), so require doesn’t rule anything\n   out.\n•  A parallel link to E (A10) is never\n   node-protecting: it ends at E.\n•  Overload bit on E (A17): N can’t pass through E,\n   so the right side is ∞.\n•  Remote LFA and TI-LFA have their own node mode\n   (B12, B19).",
   "originalText": "•  D = E: node protection can’t apply (E is the\n   destination), so require doesn’t rule anything\n   out.\n•  A parallel link to E (A10) is never\n   node-protecting: it ends at E.\n•  Overload bit on E (A17): N can’t pass through E,\n   so the right side is ∞.\n•  Remote LFA and TI-LFA have their own node mode\n   (B12, B19).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-rectangle-55",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1030,
   "width": 1640,
   "height": 117,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
