   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Takeaway",
   "originalText": "Takeaway",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b05-text-57",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1086,
   "width": 1581,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 451383,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5969553,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A link-only LFA protects against the link S–E failing, but its path may run through router E. If the whole router fails, that backup dies too. dist(N,D) < dist(N,E) +\ndist(E,D) proves N’s path avoids E, so the backup survives either failure. That is why it is step 1 of the choice.",
   "originalText": "A link-only LFA protects against the link S–E failing, but its path may run through router E. If the whole router fails, that backup dies too. dist(N,D) < dist(N,E) +\ndist(E,D) proves N’s path avoids E, so the backup survives either failure. That is why it is step 1 of the choice.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
