   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §2, §8.1, §15 (worked example)  ·  docs/learn/04-lfa.md (Inequality 3)  ·  examples/06-link-protecting.yaml, 01-square.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml  ·  checked\nwith computeLfa(), simulateFailure()",
